cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the preprint as below."
title: >-
  FrontierDrugBench: Can One Large Language Model Rival Specialists across Drug
  Discovery and Development?
abstract: >-
  1,196 expert-authored tasks covering five biological domains (Disease Biology,
  Molecular Biology, Cell Biology, In-vivo Study and Clinical Research) plus a
  separately reported 42-task Live Benchmark, evaluated zero-shot against
  experimental readouts, structural and clinical references and computational
  design scores. This release distributes the 971 external tasks.
authors:
  - name: "LGLab Frontier AI Group"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: dataset
url: "https://oribench.lglab.ac.cn/fdb"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LG-FrontierAI/FrontierDrugBench"
keywords:
  - drug-discovery
  - biomedical
  - llm-evaluation
  - benchmark
